**Checks that passed:**
- **Vendor:** libs/LibKa0s and tests/_kit match `git archive` of v1.81.0 (56ebc24) exactly. Icons are declared "all", so nothing was pruned. The CLAUDE.md provenance line and the 4 version pins now read v1.81.0.
